---
// Segment review, ALPHV Group of Companies: the review itself. A lead statement, the account in two
// report columns, and the founder's stated mission as a pull quote.
// Sources: .source/content.md "Case study: ALPHV Group of Companies", "Achievements & recognition",
// "Identity" (LinkedIn headline: AI, data & cloud solutions across SEA); content.ts `group`.
---

<section class="review" aria-labelledby="review-heading">
  <h2 id="review-heading" class="section-heading">Review</h2>

  <div class="body">
    <p class="lead" data-reveal>
      ALPHV builds AI, data and cloud solutions for businesses across Southeast Asia. Around that work it trains
      professionals, convenes Malaysia’s largest developer community and recruits technical talent.
    </p>

    <div class="columns" data-reveal>
      <p>
        ALPHV, formerly alphatechlabs, was founded in April 2023 by Daren Tan and co-founder Jeng Yee Khor.<a
          class="note-ref"
          href="#note-5"
          aria-label="Note 5">5</a
        > The group works to three pillars: Develop. Educate. Innovate.
      </p>
      <p>
        ALPHV Technologies takes projects from concept to deployment across web and mobile, computer vision, data
        science and engineering, AI/ML and GenAI, and DevOps and MLOps. ALPHV Academy has run HRDC-claimable training
        since 2023 for engineers, managers and <span class="nowrap">C-suite</span> leaders. ALPHV DevRel runs developer
        relations, campaigns and hackathons with technology partners, and is home to Developer Kaki. ALPHV Recruit
        handles tech recruitment and headhunting across Malaysia and Southeast Asia.
      </p>
      <p>
        Partnerships followed within two years. In January 2025 ALPHV became an official authorised reseller of
        FootfallCam and HIKVision,<a class="note-ref" href="#note-6" aria-label="Note 6">6</a> and in February 2025 the
        first Malaysian Global Strategic Partner of Alibaba Cloud, a status it also holds with FPT AI Factory.<a
          class="note-ref"
          href="#note-2"
          aria-label="Note 2">2</a
        > Three ALPHV entities were featured in Konsortium AI Negara 2025.<a
          class="note-ref"
          href="#note-3"
          aria-label="Note 3">3</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="mission" data-reveal>
      <blockquote>
        <p>
          <span class="open" aria-hidden="true">“</span>…transform both the private and public sectors, particularly in
          enhancing the delivery of government services to the rakyat through the modern, proven and sustainable
          technology.<span aria-hidden="true">”</span
          >
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption>
        Daren Tan, Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer, on the group’s mission<a
          class="note-ref"
          href="#note-7"
          aria-label="Note 7">7</a
        >
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

